19.3.6 Selection scenario
The selection scenario is specified by the monitor activity select statement (see Syntax 75):
action read {}
action write {}
action send {}
monitor m {
  activity {
    overlap {
      do read;
      do write;
      do send;
    }
  }
}

Syntax 75—Select monitor activity statement
The selection scenario defines a selection between several alternative subscenarios. The set of realizations of
the selection scenario consists of all realizations of its subscenarios. Consider Example 197 and the trace
shown in Figure 42.
